                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>President Truman’s speech on April 4 at the ceremony for the signing of the
                    Atlantic Pact contained a statement designed to endorse and emphasize recent
                    statements by the Secretary of State on Iran, as well as on Greece and Turkey;
                    for text, see circular telegram of April 2, <ref
                        target="frus:frus1949v04/pg_270">volume IV, page 270</ref>.</p>
            </div>
